    "text": "The number of points in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;for which <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;is:",
